    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/foxlodge-kilteel-naas-kildare-w91-v-38d\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present Fox Lodge, Foxcovert Lane, Naas in Kildare.\r\n\r\nNestled in the peaceful surroundings of Kilteel, Naas, this beautifully designed detached home offers a tranquil setting, generous accommodation, and a wonderfully practical layout suited to family living.\r\n\r\nApproaching the property, you are greeted by a well-maintained exterior with an attractive lawn, mature shrubs, and landscaped planting, creating a strong sense of kerb appeal. A generous driveway provides ample parking, adding further convenience for families and visitors.\r\n\r\nInside, the home opens into a welcoming porch and a spacious entrance hall, which acts as the central point of the property and connects the main living spaces with ease. The living room is particularly impressive, offering a bright and airy setting with large windows that allow natural light to flow through the room. This generous space is ideal for family relaxation, entertaining guests, or enjoying quiet evenings at home.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is well appointed and offers excellent space for everyday cooking, dining, and family life. Its practical layout, ample cabinetry, and generous workspace make it a highly functional part of the home. A second kitchen/utility-style area adds further flexibility, providing useful additional preparation or storage space and enhancing the overall practicality of the property.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes five well-proportioned bedrooms, each offering comfortable space and natural light. These rooms provide excellent flexibility for growing families, guests, home working, or additional living needs. Two of the bedrooms benefit from ensuite bathrooms, adding a welcome level of privacy and convenience, while a separate main family bathroom serves the remaining accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe rear garden is a standout feature, offering a peaceful outdoor retreat with a lush lawn and patio area, ideal for outdoor entertaining, children’s play, or quiet relaxation. The setting gives the property a calm and private feel, making it especially appealing for those seeking space and tranquillity.\r\n\r\nPractical aspects of the home include a septic tank, which has been cleaned out, along with a water pump house and installed treatment system for the well, supporting day-to-day convenience and water quality. The location also provides access to local amenities, including schools, sports clubs, and transport links to Naas and beyond, making it well suited to family life.\r\n\r\nThis property is ideally suited to buyers seeking a larger family home in a quiet yet accessible location. With its generous living space, five-bedroom layout, two ensuite bedrooms, landscaped surroundings, and peaceful setting, Fox Lodge offers a superb opportunity to enjoy comfortable countryside living within easy reach of nearby amenities."
